{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30847","headline":"送顾少府之永康 · 马戴","name":"送顾少府之永康","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"婺女星边去，春生即有花。\n寒关云复雪，古渡草连沙。\n宿次吴江晚，行侵日徼斜。\n官传梅福政，县顾赤松家。\n烧起明山翠，潮回动海霞。\n清高宜阅此，莫叹近天涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}